}</script></a></div><div class="testimonals-content-wrapper fade-in-up"><img src="/images/quotes.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="quotes-image"><p class="testimonials-paragraph">Perseverance with Passion.<br><br>TBW Law began with a mission: to secure justice and compensation for those affected by accidents. By fighting relentlessly in court, we strive to alleviate the burdens of our clients and enhance their well-being - our ultimate goal.</p><div class="testimonials-name">Ted B. Wacker</div><div class="testimonials-position">Founding Partner</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section resources padding-small"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper-tablet"><div class="heading-button-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading no-margin fade">In the news</h2><a href="/blog?category=Recent+News" class="button white hide-tablet fade-up inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>View all news »</div></div></a></div><div class="resourses-list-wrapper list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="resourses-list list-items"><div role="listitem" class="resourses-list-item fade-in-up list-item"><a href="/blog/ted-wacker-will-moderator-the-caoie-caoc-octla-palm-springs-seminar" class="blog-image-link inline-block"><img src="/images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="/images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-500.png 500w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-800.png 800w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb.png 1630w" class="cms-image"></a><div class="category-list list-wrapper"><div role="list" class="collection-list-4 list-items"><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Events &amp; Sponsorship</div></div><div role="listitem" class="list-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Recent News</div></div></div></div><div class="cms-title">Ted Wacker will moderator the CAOIE CAOC OCTLA Palm Springs Seminar</div></div><di